{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54664","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 二 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日旁气，赤色若（京本作「似」）悬钟。\n所见之时（辛本、川本、京本作「游所见边」）须将死，不论春夏与秋冬，所举总成空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54664.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54664","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}